        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>资金同业业务 — 银行业务关键指标</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1000px;\n    min-height: 1414px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 215px 78px 40px 68px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  /* Right side vertical tab */\n  .side-tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 300px;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 245px;\n    background: #f47b20;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 6px 0 0 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .side-tab span {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n  }\n\n  h2.section {\n    color: #00954c;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  p.lead {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 0 0 40px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Icon + text rows */\n  .icon-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .icon-label {\n    width: 40px;\n    color: #f47b20;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #f0a877;\n    color: #c07a45;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #fffaf6;\n  }\n  .icon-ph {\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 100px;\n    margin: 0 90px 0 12px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .icon-text {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .dotted-sep {\n    border-top: 2px dotted #f47b20;\n    margin: 18px 0 18px 265px;\n  }\n\n  h2.section2 {\n    color: #00954c;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 60px 0 22px 0;\n  }\n\n  table.kpi {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  table.kpi th, table.kpi td {\n    padding: 8px 4px;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n  }\n  table.kpi thead th {\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #f47b20;\n    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #58585a;\n  }\n  table.kpi thead th.unit { text-align: left; }\n  table.kpi thead th.cur { color: #f47b20; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; }\n  table.kpi thead th.prev { color: #f4a26a; text-align: center; }\n  table.kpi thead th.chg { color: #f47b20; text-align: right; }\n\n  table.kpi td.label { text-align: left; width: 42%; }\n  table.kpi td.v1 { text-align: center; width: 20%; font-weight: 700; }\n  table.kpi td.v2 { text-align: center; width: 20%; }\n  table.kpi td.v3 { text-align: right; width: 18%; }\n\n  tr.row td { border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d9d9; }\n  tr.head-group td { font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d9d9; }\n  tr.last td { border-bottom: 2px solid #f47b20; }\n  .indent1 { padding-left: 26px !important; }\n  .indent2 { padding-left: 60px !important; }\n  sup { font-size: 10px; }\n\n  .table-gap { height: 34px; }\n\n  .notes {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #58585a;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .notes div { text-indent: 0; }\n  .notes .n { margin-left: 26px; }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 68px;\n    right: 78px;\n    bottom: 34px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .footer .left {\n    color: #f47b20;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .footer .right {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  .footer .pageno {\n    color: #f47b20;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-left: 14px;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"side-tab\"><span>经营情况讨论及分析</span></div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\">资金同业业务</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">平安银行资金同业业务通过 \"投资交易+客户业务\" 双轮驱动，持续提升投资、交易和销售三大能力，助力金融市场高质量发展。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"icon-row\">\n    <div class=\"icon-label\">投资交易</div>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 投资交易 图标]</figure>\n    <div class=\"icon-text\">\n      平安银行加强宏观分析研判，在保障资产端的流动性与安全性前提下，优化交易策略，合理配置持仓组合，保持稳健投资。2024年，平安银行债券交易量的市场份额为4.4%，同比上升1.2个百分点。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dotted-sep\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"icon-row\">\n    <div class=\"icon-label\">客户业务</div>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 客户业务 图标]</figure>\n    <div class=\"icon-text\">\n      平安银行依托客户综合服务优势，在做市、避险、机构销售、托管等多领域积极发力。2024年，平安银行境内外机构销售的现券交易量4.54万亿元，同比增长46.0%；在平安银行办理外汇即期及衍生品避险业务的客户达14,987户，同比增长16.5%；截至2024年12月31日，通过 \"行e通\" 平台销售的资管产品保有规模2,667.05亿元，较年初增长33.2%；托管净值规模达9.10万亿元，较年初增长4.6%。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section2\">银行业务关键指标</h2>\n\n  <table class=\"kpi\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"unit\">（人民币百万元）</th>\n        <th class=\"cur\">2024年</th>\n        <th class=\"prev\">2023年</th>\n        <th class=\"chg\">变动(%)</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"head-group\"><td class=\"label\">经营成果</td><td class=\"v1\"></td><td class=\"v2\"></td><td class=\"v3\"></td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">营业收入</td><td class=\"v1\">146,695</td><td class=\"v2\">164,699</td><td class=\"v3\">（10.9）</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">净利润</td><td class=\"v1\">44,508</td><td class=\"v2\">46,455</td><td class=\"v3\">（4.2）</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">成本收入比(%)</td><td class=\"v1\">27.66</td><td class=\"v2\">27.90</td><td class=\"v3\">下降0.24个百分点</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">平均总资产收益率(%)</td><td class=\"v1\">0.78</td><td class=\"v2\">0.85</td><td class=\"v3\">下降0.07个百分点</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">加权平均净资产收益率(%)</td><td class=\"v1\">10.08</td><td class=\"v2\">11.38</td><td class=\"v3\">下降1.30个百分点</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row last\"><td class=\"label\">净息差(%)</td><td class=\"v1\">1.87</td><td class=\"v2\">2.38</td><td class=\"v3\">下降0.51个百分点</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"table-gap\"></div>\n\n  <table class=\"kpi\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"unit\">（人民币百万元）</th>\n        <th class=\"cur\">2024年12月31日</th>\n        <th class=\"prev\">2023年12月31日</th>\n        <th class=\"chg\">变动</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"head-group\"><td class=\"label\">存贷款业务<sup>(1)</sup></td><td class=\"v1\"></td><td class=\"v2\"></td><td class=\"v3\"></td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">吸收存款</td><td class=\"v1\">3,533,678</td><td class=\"v2\">3,407,295</td><td class=\"v3\">3.7%</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label indent1\">其中：个人存款</td><td class=\"v1\">1,287,180</td><td class=\"v2\">1,207,618</td><td class=\"v3\">6.6%</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label indent2\">企业存款</td><td class=\"v1\">2,246,498</td><td class=\"v2\">2,199,677</td><td class=\"v3\">2.1%</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">发放贷款和垫款总额</td><td class=\"v1\">3,374,103</td><td class=\"v2\">3,407,509</td><td class=\"v3\">（1.0%）</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label indent1\">其中：个人贷款</td><td class=\"v1\">1,767,168</td><td class=\"v2\">1,977,719</td><td class=\"v3\">（10.6%）</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row last\"><td class=\"label indent2\">企业贷款</td><td class=\"v1\">1,606,935</td><td class=\"v2\">1,429,790</td><td class=\"v3\">12.4%</td></tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"head-group\"><td class=\"label\">资产质量</td><td class=\"v1\"></td><td class=\"v2\"></td><td class=\"v3\"></td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">不良贷款率(%)</td><td class=\"v1\">1.06</td><td class=\"v2\">1.06</td><td class=\"v3\">–</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">拨备覆盖率(%)</td><td class=\"v1\">250.71</td><td class=\"v2\">277.63</td><td class=\"v3\">下降26.92个百分点</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row\"><td class=\"label\">逾期60天以上贷款偏离度<sup>(2)</sup></td><td class=\"v1\">0.80</td><td class=\"v2\">0.74</td><td class=\"v3\">上升0.06</td></tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"head-group\"><td class=\"label\">资本充足率</td><td class=\"v1\"></td><td class=\"v2\"></td><td class=\"v3\"></td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"row last\"><td class=\"label\">核心一级资本充足率<sup>(3)</sup>(%)</td><td class=\"v1\">9.12</td><td class=\"v2\">9.22</td><td class=\"v3\">下降0.10个百分点</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"notes\">\n    <div>注：（1）吸收存款、发放贷款和垫款总额及其明细项目均为不含息金额。</div>\n    <div class=\"n\">（2）逾期60天以上贷款偏离度=逾期60天以上贷款余额／不良贷款余额。</div>\n    <div class=\"n\">（3）核心一级资本充足率的最低监管要求为7.75%。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"left\">二零二四年年报</div>\n    <div class=\"right\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司<span class=\"pageno\">51</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
